WEBVTT

00:25:28.985 --> 00:25:30.592
business opportunity,

00:25:30.592 --> 00:25:33.015
but one of the most profound transitions

00:25:33.015 --> 00:25:35.531
in the history of our species.

00:25:35.531 --> 00:25:38.954
We humans are inventing a new fire,

00:25:38.954 --> 00:25:40.698
not dug from below,

00:25:40.698 --> 00:25:43.605
but flowing from above;

00:25:43.605 --> 00:25:46.536
not scarce, but bountiful;

00:25:46.536 --> 00:25:48.236
not local, but everywhere;

00:25:48.236 --> 00:25:50.867
not transient, but permanent;

00:25:50.867 --> 00:25:53.767
not costly, but free.

00:25:53.767 --> 00:25:57.167
And but for a little transitional tail of natural gas

00:25:57.167 --> 00:26:00.729
and a bit of biofuel grown in ways that sustain and endure,